      <Placemark>
        <name>Avenida North Garage (Discovery Green / GRB campus)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<b>Avenida North Garage (Discovery Green / GRB campus)</b><br/>
Operator: Houston First (Avenida Houston) / ParkMobile / ParkWhiz<br/>
Address: 1002 Avenida de Las Americas, Houston, TX 77010<br/>
City: Houston<br/>
Spaces: 1848<br/>
Rates: Official posted: $15 (0-1 hr), $25 (1-2 hr), $34 (2-4 hr), $45 daily maximum. Billing cycle typically resets ~2 a.m.<br/>
Pay method: Ticket-on-entry + kiosk; ParkMobile / ParkWhiz reservations<br/>
Confidence: Confirmed pay-by-phone capable (kiosk + reservation)<br/>
Est. annual revenue (low / base / high): $3,353,455 / $5,395,864 / $7,855,981 — ESTIMATE<br/>
Est. weekday / weekend (base): $3,781,452 / $1,614,413<br/>
Coordinates: 29.7531092, -95.3586352 (decimal degrees, WGS84)<br/>
Method: spaces x days x occupancy x turnover x blended rate. Blended rate is an estimate below the $45 daily max to allow for short stays (weekday $28, weekend $32). Occupancy is an estimate: TTI PRC 17-88-F (Jan 2018) found Houston public-garage weekday mean occupancy ~66% (range 52.9-79.9%), but that figure covers all public garages including commuter use and is not applied raw to a convention garage. ParkHouston May 4, 2023 council slides (6 p.m.-midnight curbside, Downtown &amp; East Downtown) show mixed weekday evenings (many blocks under 50%, some 50-79%, a few cores over 80%) and busier but not uniformly full weekend evenings. Convention demand is peaky, so weekday occupancy used here is 28% (scenario) rather than 66%.<br/>
Pay-by-phone capable but not a typical QR walk-up lot. Avenida Central (663 spaces) was listed as temporarily closed, reopen Fall 2026, and is omitted from revenue totals.<br/>
Source: https://www.avenidahouston.com/ and George R. Brown Convention Center parking pages]]></description>
        <Point><coordinates>-95.3586352,29.7531092,0</coordinates></Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
