        <description><![CDATA[<b>Tundra Garage (Toyota Center)</b><br/>
Operator: Toyota Center / ParkMobile (reservations); event operator<br/>
Address: 1510 Polk Street, Houston, TX 77002<br/>
City: Houston<br/>
Spaces: 2478<br/>
Rates: Event-variable; official public pages do not publish a single year-round card. Dollar estimates below use a labeled assumed event rate and should be read as a wide range, not a measured figure.<br/>
Pay method: Event parking; ParkMobile reservations; rates variable<br/>
Confidence: Confirmed pay-by-phone capable (event / reservation)<br/>
Est. annual revenue (low / base / high): $2,173,206 / $4,946,088 / $9,850,050 — ESTIMATE<br/>
Est. weekday / weekend (base): $2,525,259 / $2,420,829<br/>
Coordinates: 29.7507473, -95.3622315 (decimal degrees, WGS84)<br/>
Method: EVENT-RATE ESTIMATE (wide uncertainty). Event days 80, occupancy 55%, assumed event rate $35 (not a published year-round card). Non-event days 285 at 8% occupancy and assumed $20. Weekday/weekend split of event revenue is an estimate (45/55). Do not treat this as a measured figure.<br/>
Treated like official venue parking, not a typical QR walk-up lot. Included in Houston city sensitivity, not used as the QR walk-up #1 lot.<br/>
Source: Official Toyota Center / GRB parking pages]]></description>
