        <name>Alamo Lot</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<b>Alamo Lot</b><br/>
Operator: City of San Antonio / SAPark<br/>
Address: 313 Alamo Plaza, San Antonio, TX 78205<br/>
City: San Antonio<br/>
Spaces: 61<br/>
Rates: City facility; peer published cards ($10 weekday cap / $5 evenings-weekends) used and labeled as an assumption. Event pricing may apply.<br/>
Pay method: City lot / SAPark<br/>
Confidence: Confirmed city lot (rates assumed from peer city cards)<br/>
Est. annual revenue (low / base / high): $84,332 / $106,534 / $144,782 — ESTIMATE<br/>
Est. weekday / weekend (base): $87,566 / $18,969<br/>
Coordinates: 29.4254369, -98.4870717 (decimal degrees, WGS84)<br/>
Method: Peer city rates. Occupancy set higher than downtown-wide because this is at Alamo Plaza (weekday 55%, weekend 52% in this scenario). High weekend may exceed the 53% citywide Fiesta peak; that 53% was a downtown-wide figure, not a single-lot cap.<br/>
Small official lot at Alamo Plaza. Occupancy set higher than citywide because this is at the primary tourist address, but still capped by the 53% Fiesta peak for the high weekend case? Actually core lots can exceed citywide average — high weekend 60% is used here and labeled as an estimate above the 53% citywide figure.<br/>
Source: City of San Antonio parking listings]]></description>
