      <Placemark>
        <name>Houston Street Garage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<b>Houston Street Garage</b><br/>
Operator: City of San Antonio / SAPark<br/>
Address: 240 E Houston Street, San Antonio, TX 78205<br/>
City: San Antonio<br/>
Spaces: 900<br/>
Rates: Official example card: $3/hour with a $10 daily cap (Houston Street Garage). Meters are free after 6 p.m. and all day Sunday; some city garage promotions (free after 5 p.m. Tuesdays) also apply. Event rates may be higher.<br/>
Pay method: City garage / SAPark (pay-by-phone / app program)<br/>
Confidence: Confirmed pay-by-app / city garage<br/>
Est. annual revenue (low / base / high): $962,550 / $1,273,266 / $1,577,196 — ESTIMATE<br/>
Est. weekday / weekend (base): $1,057,050 / $216,216<br/>
Coordinates: 29.4263849, -98.4906512 (decimal degrees, WGS84)<br/>
Method: Weekday uses the published $10 daily cap x 45% occupancy x 1.0 turn x 261 days. Weekend uses $5 (the published St. Mary's evenings/weekends visitor rate, also applied here as a conservative weekend visitor rate) x 42% x weekend turnover. High weekend occupancy is capped at 53%, the reported Fiesta 2025 Saturday night downtown-wide peak. Sunday meter-free policy may further reduce weekend paid demand; that is one reason the weekend rate is not set at the weekday cap.<br/>
City-owned. Downtown-wide Fiesta 2025 Saturday night peak occupancy was only 53% (Centro study as reported March 2026 by Axios and CultureMap).<br/>
Source: City of San Antonio parking / ConnectSA; Axios 2026-03-23; CultureMap]]></description>
